### 1. A random joke
GET http://localhost:3000/random

### 2. Joke number 3
GET http://localhost:3000/jokes/3

### 2. A joke that doesn't exist
GET http://localhost:3000/jokes/99

### 3. Only the Puns
GET http://localhost:3000/filter?type=Puns

### 4. Add a joke (the body is sent the same way a form sends it)
POST http://localhost:3000/jokes
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

text=Why did the developer go broke? He used up all his cache.&type=Programming

### 5. Replace joke 1 completely
PUT http://localhost:3000/jokes/1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

text=I would tell you a UDP joke, but you might not get it.&type=Programming

### 6. Change only the type of joke 2
PATCH http://localhost:3000/jokes/2
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

type=Chemistry

### 7. Delete joke 4
DELETE http://localhost:3000/jokes/4
